## Quick Links

### Check Your Version

```bash
# See your current Pika version
cat .pika-sync.json | grep pikaVersion
```

### Update to Latest

```bash
# See what's changed
pika sync --dry-run

# Apply updates
pika sync
```

### Get Help

Having issues? Check our [Troubleshooting Guide](/platform/troubleshooting/) first, then reach out to the [Community](/platform/community/).

### Contribute

Want to help improve Pika? Read our [Contributing Guide](/platform/contributing/) to get started.

